  "evidenceBoundary": "Actual Hono request handlers, temporary SQLite Store, filesystem observations and pure UI matrix/protocol. Root owns production browser acceptance. No paid calls, staging or commits. Intermediate failed runs preserved: restart fixture double shutdown and expected active-Run recovery changed phase; fixed fixture lifecycle before final 57/57.",
